{"title": "Two Earthquakes Strike Ladakh Region", "summary": "Two earthquakes of moderate intensity struck the Ladakh region within a four-hour period. The first tremor registered a magnitude of 5.5, while the second measured 4.3. No immediate reports of damage or casualties were mentioned in the coverage.", "summary_points": ["Two earthquakes occurred in Ladakh within four hours.", "The first earthquake had a magnitude of 5.5.", "The second earthquake had a magnitude of 4.3.", "Both earthquakes were described as moderate-intensity."], "title_hi": "लद्दाख क्षेत्र में दो भूकंप आए", "summary_hi": "चार घंटे की अवधि के भीतर लद्दाख क्षेत्र में मध्यम तीव्रता के दो भूकंप आए। पहले भूकंप की तीव्रता 5.5 मापी गई, जबकि दूसरे की तीव्रता 4.3 मापी गई। कवरेज में तत्काल किसी नुकसान या हताहतों की सूचना नहीं दी गई थी।", "summary_points_hi": ["चार घंटे के भीतर लद्दाख में दो भूकंप आए।", "पहले भूकंप की तीव्रता 5.5 थी।", "दूसरे भूकंप की तीव्रता 4.3 थी।", "दोनों भूकंपों को मध्यम तीव्रता का बताया गया।"], "framing": {}, "framing_hi": {}, "topic": "Environment", "region": "India", "published_at": null, "image_url": "", "sources": [{"source": "The Hindu", "owner": "The Hindu Group", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/ladakh/two-moderate-intensity-earthquakes-hit-ladakh-within-four-hours/article71339828.ece", "headline": "Two moderate-intensity earthquakes hit Ladakh within four hours"}, {"source": "The Print", "owner": "The Print", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Two moderate-intensity earthquakes hit Ladakh within four hours"}, {"source": "Deccan Chronicle", "owner": "Deccan Chronicle", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Two Moderate-Intensity Earthquakes Hit Ladakh Within Four Hours"}, {"source": "Greater Kashmir", "owner": "Greater Kashmir", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Two moderate-intens